  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following relations is true for two unit vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> making an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;to each other?",
